{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic警告投資者，該公司直言不諱地倡導人工智能（AI）安全可能使其成為政府報復的目標。在過去一年與特朗普政府多次發生摩擦後，這一表態凸顯出政府相關風險對Anthropic未來業務構成的影響可能非同尋常。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584206.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T18:00:41.523072+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T17:56:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:58:14.977223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T17:58:14.977223+00:00","content_hash":"6369dab1eb4f1646a895a60cfd3fd9a782a1049be8f6a80c9b8b1b69b6285bc3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}